+ * Gen2 firmware of the VPU 2.0 core (SM8450, SM8475): no partial data
+ * buffer, and HFI_CMD_RESUME is sent without a payload, as the vendor
+ * driver does. With a payload the firmware does not resume decoding.
+ */
